      "created_at": "2019-05-30T06:56:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, all, I'm new here; found SotM video game&nbsp;through the Tabletop Humble Bundle a year or two ago but only&nbsp;started playing it this last fall.&nbsp;I quickly grew addicted, bought both Season Passes, and am&nbsp;about halfway through the backlog of Letters Page episodes.<br>\n<br>\nOn the Inverse Universe Episode of the Letters Page, I could have sworn Christopher or Adam said that Legacy of Destruction was depicted on one card in the game. I've skimmed every card on the SotM video game&nbsp;and could only find Iron Legacy or The Dreamer's Dark Hero projection. (I couldn't find him on the Sentinels Wiki either).&nbsp;Does anyone know which card has Legacy of Destruction on it? I have a theory or at least head cannon that I want to check by seeing a picture of him.</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
